#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""VoiceIME streaming ASR engine.

Realtime path:
  SIGUSR2 -> start recording immediately
  SIGUSR1 -> stop recording and commit the streaming final text

FireRedASR2 + optional LLM refinement run asynchronously after the streaming
result is committed. The engine stays responsive to the next utterance while
refinement is in flight. Session-aware Fcitx updates make late results fail
closed once the user edits/moves the cursor or a new utterance begins.
"""
